{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d0889805013c2120b762be7a698ac641f58ef570741cde23acab0ce575ba5fa8", "ja": "（今日は、\nひなたの宣材写真を撮りに来たんだけど……）", "zh": "（今天要来拍\n日向的宣传照，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "66d2f29164e5c1c6370e130bad9198abeb4f28c23546d070f482d0312ed583fb", "ja": "あう、うう……。", "zh": "啊呜、呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bbffeaec868207744d20b633483f5da6d34cfe066bbf8449c7840b325a97fee3", "ja": "（プロのメイクや、初めて見る機材……\n大勢のスタッフさん達に、圧倒されているみたいだ）", "zh": "（专业的化妆师、没见过的器材……\n以及众多的工作人员似乎让日向感到怯场。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "53606c50bc4bbc4625af0b5058e490e0e2bb480d6b3008906d86f11e3da9bcd9", "ja": "き、木下ひなたですっ。\n……今日は、よろしくお願いします……！", "zh": "我、我叫做木下日向。\n……今天还请大家多多指教……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1004_camman", "source_sha256": "10609c2b8a8e06520543830aa8802cabecfde0a62feebfae757055d5a4aa0252", "ja": "はい、よろしくお願いしますね。\nじゃあ早速、撮影始めましょう！", "zh": "好的，请多指教哦。\n那么就赶快来拍照吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1005_camman", "source_sha256": "2ade067e78bded05671b170c2286b464536680030a02def1f7a564252a4a2518", "ja": "うーん……ひなたちゃん、ちょっと表情が硬いかな？\n自然な笑顔がほしいんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……日向妹妹，你的表情是不是有点僵硬呢？\n我想要拍点自然的笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "b3072a9c70cc072ed01e6551761abc698956cd26063b35fd781d09a8a64aafb6", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい……。\n……うぅ、あたし、全然ダメだわ……。", "zh": "对、对不起……\n……呜呜，我好没用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f8340f2e2c18f97c16b11ae8579fc01ad95cdee523a237348d5fdef7e6fbed61", "ja": "すみません、ちょっと休憩させてください。\n……ひなた、大丈夫か？", "zh": "不好意思，请让我们休息一下。\n……日向，还好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "6f6243ef85f7250ea69865e4c546ad527cb823007d4466b8b697443338cf85ab", "ja": "{$P$}……。あたし、\nなんだか、わかんなくなってきちゃったべさ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n我现在搞不太懂了哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ee28f90941eb641561f5f9f440ba142d9b24387fa98a05b270255c364fe46a1d", "ja": "わからないって、何がだ？", "zh": "搞不懂什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "ad1b7b083faa5af420c127e7f52e41b82db878265542b7b4237ab4fd3064a642", "ja": "あのね……。\nどうしたら、うそっこでなく笑えるんだべか……？", "zh": "那个呀……\n要怎么样才能发自内心地笑哪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "c670d457580d43673606b56d0f2b301891970719d787e5fc9fc1e51bf7d1cf4a", "ja": "頑張って笑おうとしたんだけども、\nなんも、面白いことがあったわけじゃなし……。", "zh": "我虽然很努力想露出笑容，\n但是又没有发生有趣的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "d9f0f7fdf9c10d18be477b74bf663606a3ddcb325d073526e5efcfcc38c2b306", "ja": "うそっこだって思うと、ほっぺたが\n引きつってきちゃって。全然ダメなんだわぁ。", "zh": "一想到这样笑是在骗人，\n我的脸就会僵住，完全行不通啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d6ae5868de099092d0be6f7866eec7afe4c08a19596077f2e54e0f08ea66d2dd", "ja": "ウソを吐く度に、顔が引きつっちゃうのか？\nじゃあ、ひなたはウソが吐けないな。", "zh": "原来日向骗人时脸会僵住吗？\n那你就不能随便骗人了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "d262bd10ad7549ab5dcd62bab22d9cd749284a9d3c7465cd494fae204f94f2d3", "ja": "うう、笑いごとじゃねぇべさ……。\nどうしたらいいんだべ……。", "zh": "呜呜，不要笑我哪……\n我该怎么办才好哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "722d488c466e3472abec313dcd2beb1cce22a3d589c32e1fe6d66f8402fb8c83", "ja": "そうだな……。普段、\nひなたの家では、どんな時に写真を撮ってた？", "zh": "我想想……日向，\n你家平常都是哪些时候会拍照呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "c9a7ed48ce4814d9bf6b8ccf109265f6f6b3a08714bd11712f578a79bcf67511", "ja": "えっと……うちでは、お正月とか、\n人がたくさん来た時に撮ってたよぉ。", "zh": "呃……我家都是在新年那种\n有很多客人来的时候会拍照哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b0e7ddaf049d34026aec85daedfccba703eb7dab1316b3ce872f2bceb4f58a66", "ja": "なるほど……。ひなたの家なら、\nたくさん人が集まるんじゃないか？", "zh": "原来如此……\n日向家里应该会有很多人会来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "d92f174987611a04d4cf09704088883b314c8da24fc29dfa477988303d98c585", "ja": "うん！　毎年、大勢来るよぉ。\nだから鍋いっぱいに、お煮しめこさえてね……。", "zh": "嗯！每年都有很多人哦～\n所以都会煮一大锅炖菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "e2e85ab4509231fe7818430dd4f31514155c1b0f608a746d3497413634311400", "ja": "あとは、見たことないくらい大きな野菜が取れた時も、\n写真を撮ったよぉ。大きなカボチャだったべさ！", "zh": "另外，采收到没人看过的特大号蔬菜时，\n也会拍照哦～像是大南瓜哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "f9257e424de5eb00a9510271e76ab4c10a2434ff57af6cdd14b66bb3d863ee0d", "ja": "それと、小学校の入学式とか、行事の時とか。\nじいちゃんやばあちゃん、みんなで来てくれて……。", "zh": "还有，像是小学的入学典礼、举办其他活动的时候。\n爷爷、奶奶、大家都会来参加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1021_se", "source_sha256": "4606073ef0fddc0c72eeaaa7e8e18c73d9c237e22b8a473a522510d76efe305e", "ja": "パシャ！　パシャパシャ！！", "zh": "喀嚓！喀嚓喀嚓！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "5dca888c4f89ee704aa3ef967c2eb513ede2771c2bb852ba31ed3c3404aa0478", "ja": "わぁっ！？", "zh": "哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "c938949cebc04114e2b814b7d5d13c160c000c9a03cf95f27d016482c5ba277b", "ja": "い……今の、カメラかい？\nび、びっくりしたぁ……。", "zh": "刚……刚才那是快门声吗？\n吓、吓我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1024_camman", "source_sha256": "075cd04d3598f683146edd2032c5f1270ec71335dc45ae28d777acc6b9846560", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい！\n自然ないい笑顔だったから、つい体が動いちゃって。", "zh": "啊，抱歉！\n因为你露出很自然的灿烂笑容，我不由自主就拍了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "ab4bff1500b034c490b91d09c40ec45161e7799ba9b54379c4a215b4786de026", "ja": "えっ……ほ、本当かいっ？", "zh": "咦……真、真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1026_camman", "source_sha256": "8dc85b4eb506cfd685704bee98e782e6405471f7d05a5d3a42a6c6e52e42b8f9", "ja": "ええ、とっても素敵だった！\n今の感じを忘れないうちに、撮影再開しましょうか！", "zh": "真的啊，你的笑容很棒！\n趁刚才的感觉还在，赶快继续拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "8f372c5149dd11e41c63730f3122c656ccad882e307060cd4e144886d923a841", "ja": "はい！　……{$P$}、\nあたし、行ってくるねぇ！", "zh": "好的！……{$P$}，\n我要去拍啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "d0d53b7ab7744ea5e6d0b72392d334ddd0b6c82e18b86957583009196ecc055d", "ja": "お疲れさまでした。\n……ふぅ、無事終わってよかったよぉ。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n……呼，幸好成功拍完了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9589685a9043da2ab82cedf86722907e1c704f71a00c849e69fdb770ee265d7c", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。\nバッチリだったな。", "zh": "辛苦你了，日向。\n拍得很棒哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "d45e5c2e5fe770904338f84aa8c0b0e07655788a8df23b74f0341f6e6e354a16", "ja": "うん……最初は困ったけど、{$P$}の\nアドバイスのおかげで、なんとかなったべさ。", "zh": "嗯……一开始虽然不知所措，但多亏有\n{$P$}的建议，总算完成了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "0800d85b7ca30997c5366014921392bdbfb9e82c03428245f0c5555dfde2536d", "ja": "ありがとねえ、{$P$}。", "zh": "谢谢你哦～{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_002_1032_p", "source_sha256": "cb1013dec1252bd1d96100fc8dbca6bcdbcda26d1f8bcab7c50c8f84d03cb1a2", "ja": "（やっぱりひなたは、自然な笑顔が一番可愛いな。\n何はともあれ、撮影がうまくいってよかった！）", "zh": "（日向还是笑得自然的时候最可爱。\n无论如何，拍摄能顺利进行真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
